# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project Name: GovAI Nexus  
Tagline: Smarter Government. Faster Services. Transparent Governance.  
Organization: Government of Tamil Nadu  
Module: AI & Analytics Centre  
Languages: English + Tamil  
Platform: Web Application  
Architecture: Python-first, AI-powered, modular and scalable.

You are working on an existing enterprise-level GovTech platform named GovAI Nexus.

Your task is to design, develop and integrate a complete AI & Analytics Centre into the existing GovAI Nexus ecosystem.

The AI & Analytics Centre is the central intelligence and analytical layer of the platform.

It must collect authorized operational data from the existing portals, process it through Python-based AI/ML pipelines, generate insights, provide predictions, detect unusual patterns and present meaningful information to authorized government administrators and decision-makers.

The AI & Analytics Centre must not be a standalone application.

It must be integrated with:

1. Public Government Website.
2. Citizen Portal.
3. Employee Portal.
4. Department Officer / HOD Portal.
5. Super Admin Portal.
6. AI & Analytics Centre.

## 1.1 Core objectives

1. Centralized government knowledge management.
2. AI-powered government information retrieval.
3. Predictive intelligence for government services.
